flue-svelte

Community-maintained, unofficial adapter derived from the Flue workspace
(https://github.com/withastro/flue), distributed under Apache-2.0.
No upstream NOTICE file was present in the source checkout.
Maintenance repository: https://github.com/xvin-zr/flue

Community distribution changes:
- package.json: renamed to flue-svelte, independently versioned, pointed
  repository/homepage/bugs at https://github.com/xvin-zr/flue, pinned the
  public SDK, and included license and attribution files.
- README.md: updated community identity, installation, links and release guidance.
The adapter implementation is unchanged. Build output is generated from it.

The upstream project name is used only to identify the origin; this package
is not an official Flue release and does not imply upstream endorsement.
